The syllabus of Computer Applications for the Commerce discipline has been revised in view of the fact that computer is used currently as a tool for various applications, especially in the field of e-Banking, e-Commerce, e-Governance, etc. Higher studies and placements, at present, greatly demand human resources with adequate knowledge in computer applications and information technology. The syllabus and the text book have been designed in order to provide options for students completing the course to pursue higher studies in Computer Applications and Commerce or make contributions in either of the two.

