c. Memory Buffer Register (MBR): It holds the data, either to be written to or read from the memory by the processor.

d. Instruction Register (IR): The instructions to be executed by the processor are stored in the instruction register.

e. Program Counter (PC): It holds the address of the next instruction to be executed by the processor.

