a) File server - A computer that stores and manages files for multiple users on a network. b) Web server - A computer dedicated to responding to requests for web pages. c) Print server - Redirects print jobs from clients to specific printers. d) Database server - Allows authorised clients to view, modify and/or delete data in a common database.

